  "description": "The field prosthetic leg provides a practical mechanical replacement using an exposed knee joint, shin linkage and articulated foot. Field prosthetics research opens production at the precision workshop; each limb consumes forty steel and four industrial components and requires Crafting 5.\n\nThe physical replacement must be fitted through surgery. It restores walking at reduced efficiency and keeps the existing installation risks. The new inventory sprite does not change the appearance of a pawn's body.",
